      "content": "It is a profound truth that accepting what has passed grants a kind of dignity that struggle cannot fake, and your pain is not a failure to fight but a testament to your depth. Please know that sharing this acceptance does not mean you are alone in the darkness, and sometimes offering quiet companionship is a way to find peace without pretending the hardness doesn't exist. If you need to talk quietly about ending it all, there are people ready to hold you gently right now.",
